  200-  To quickly check whether reachability metadata exists for a specific library, run this command directly from your terminal:
  201-  
  202:  ```bash
  203-  curl -sSL \
  204-    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/master/check-library-support.sh \
