mework.amqp:spring-rabbitmq-client:4.2.0-M2/fix-javac-fail/pi-generation-2026-10-02T01-57-27-882715Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.amqp:spring-rabbitmq-client:4.2.0-M2/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-02T01-59-39-472194Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.amqp:spring-rabbitmq-client:4.2.0-M2/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-02T02-00-43-761522Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.amqp:spring-rabbitmq-client:4.2.0-M2/populate-artifact-urls/populate_artifact_urls.log` — URL discovery succeeded, but the index edit was denied and not persisted.\n- `stats/org.springframework.amqp/spring-rabbitmq-client/4.2.0-M2/execution-metrics.json`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Restore the prepared `4.2.0-M2` test project from commit `90200d54088ee49716aea8a1a0405476a45db9b5`, confirm the `Consumer.Context` API, and implement both required overloads without replacing either one.\n2. Persist and verify the discovered `4.2.0-M2` artifact URLs in `metadata/org.springframework.amqp/spring-rabbitmq-client/index.json`.\n3. Run `compileTestJava` first, then the full coordinate test for `org.springframework.amqp:spring-rabbitmq-client:4.2.0-M2`.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01042e6aa55d248d016abf1182298487d0a3974cd81a5aba28\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 23174, "output": 1624, "cacheRead": 124032, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 148830, "cost": {"input": 0.092696, "output": 0.03248, "cacheRead": 0.049612800000000006, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.17478880000000002}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790906732885, "responseId": "resp_01042e6aa55d248d016abf116d8e8487d08affa98eaa61ec5f", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
